message: "If you use this geotechnical machine learning pipeline, dataset transformations, or inference system in academic or applied research, please cite it as below."
title: "GeoSlope-AI: Geospatial Landslide Risk Prediction System"
abstract: "A high-precision geotechnical machine learning platform and multi-model consensus framework for landslide susceptibility prediction and risk assessment in the Western Himalayas (Himachal Pradesh, India). Built on 12,409 georeferenced inventory records, 47 engineered terrain-climate predictors, and evaluated across GBDT (XGBoost), Random Forest, SVM, and Logistic Regression with zero data-leakage guarantees."
